    "centrifugeLink": false
  },
  {
    "title": "The washing machine makes a loud noise",
    "text": "A knocking, scraping, whining or other unusual noise may be related to the bearings, drum, shock absorbers, motor or other mechanical component.",
    "border": "border-purple-500",
    "centrifugeLink": false
  },
  {
    "title": "The washing machine vibrates or moves",
